VGAM-fortran
============

This project is a computational translation derived from VGAM 1.1-14 by
Thomas W. Yee and other credited contributors. The upstream package metadata,
license note, NEWS and ChangeLog are retained in original/.

The package also vendors code from the supplied `splines-fortran-v0.1.0`
translation. Its license and attribution are retained in vendor/splines/ and
its source files retain their GPL-2.0-or-later SPDX headers.

No endorsement by the original authors, the University of Auckland, R Core,
or the authors of the R splines package is implied.
